appy dress with an easy skirt, while dads and boys wear the matching collared short-sleeve shirt in the same floral story.</p>\n\n<p>The dresses keep the girls' and moms' side airy and floaty for warm-weather plans, while the shirts give the boys' and dads' side a neat, relaxed finish with a clean collar and button front. Pack it for family portraits, resort dinners, vacations, or any sunny-day plan where you want every role to feel coordinated and comfortable.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Four-role coordination:</strong> One listing covers girl dress, mother dress, boy shirt, and father shirt sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Garden floral palette:</strong> Red and pink flowers, yellow accents, green leaves, and a cream ground create a fresh matching look that photographs beautifully.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Sleeveless maxi dress:</strong> The strappy dress shape gives girls and moms an airy neckline and easy-moving skirt for warm-weather plans.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Shirt polish:</strong> Collared short-sleeve shirts add a neat finish for boys and dads without feeling stiff.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Styling pieces not included:</strong> White shorts, sandals, handbags, and other accessories shown in the photos are styling only and were intentionally excluded from this listing.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose each role and size you need, and build a family matching look that feels fresh, polished, and ready for the next sunny memory.</p>","tags":["Beach","Boy Shirt","Button Front Shirt","Child 1-2 Years","Child 2 Years","Child 3 Years","Child 4 Years","Child 5 Years","Child 6-7 Years","Child 8 Years","Child 9-10 Years","Collared Shirt","Cream","Daddy and Me","Dress & Shirt","Family Matching","Father 2XL","Father 3XL","Father 4XL","Father L","Father M","Father S","Father Shirt","Father XL","Floral","Four-Role Matching","Garden Floral","Garden Floral Print","Girl Dress","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1046964144900.html","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family Outfits",